{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SENARA: The Sacrament </i></strong>is a first-person survival horror game set aboard a massive, derelict ship, where faith, fanaticism, and abyssal horror collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on the <i>SENARA</i> for reasons unknown, you must survive and escape as it teeters on the edge of ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden cult rituals, forbidden truths, and survivors with their own agendas await you in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/932e42ac559ad35816970db9f81f162c.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/932e42ac559ad35816970db9f81f162c.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/932e42ac559ad35816970db9f81f162c.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival and Escape on a Sealed Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive within the meticulously recreated interior of a massive 6,000-ton ship, facing limited resources and constant threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the structure, discover hidden passages, and gather clues to find the key to your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c08dcd441fdbe93b3bf48872d50593db.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c08dcd441fdbe93b3bf48872d50593db.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c08dcd441fdbe93b3bf48872d50593db.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle- and Exploration-Focused Level Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The densely designed spaces, based on a real ship, gradually open up as the chapters progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items such as documents, equipment, and keys to unlock sealed areas and navigate the complex, intertwined corridors on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-changing threats create fresh tension even within familiar surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c7d002e3b5ed8e08f4312d3ac1740002.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c7d002e3b5ed8e08f4312d3ac1740002.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c7d002e3b5ed8e08f4312d3ac1740002.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounters with Constant Threatening Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fanatics and bizarre, otherworldly beings relentlessly threaten you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must use limited weapons, strategic stealth, and evasive maneuvers to avoid detection and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/6950451fb9e9741cd0ad854f5d9e37b7.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/6950451fb9e9741cd0ad854f5d9e37b7.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/6950451fb9e9741cd0ad854f5d9e37b7.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Active Story Interpretation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind all events is scattered like pieces across documents, objects, and conversations between characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must find and connect these fragments to construct the story for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on what you believe and how you interpret the clues, the story can unfold in entirely different directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/69d32cfe4c220e3455080158fd109cdb.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/69d32cfe4c220e3455080158fd109cdb.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/69d32cfe4c220e3455080158fd109cdb.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings Based on Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey toward the end, you will face decisive moments of choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These decisions affect not only your escape but also the fate of the <i>SENARA</i> and the flow of truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can decide where this story ultimately leads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61481314be23c184c36ccd4d60f54b8b.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61481314be23c184c36ccd4d60f54b8b.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61481314be23c184c36ccd4d60f54b8b.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prologue Episode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Before the Dawn: SENARA Prologue</strong></i> is a short story that explores the past of one of the main characters from the main game, shedding light on the events that began aboard the <i>SENARA</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the first piece of the truth hidden within the confined spaces that continue into the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the beginning of this entire saga for free right now.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915120?t=1767791634","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/4509fb8e6fd143b3a840446f5bac9a3d0e4339ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767791634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/909b7acb68fcaa92e36680417d8c50402484ec5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767791634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/909b7acb68fcaa92e36680417d8c50402484ec5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767791634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SENARA: The Sacrament </i></strong>is a first-person survival horror game set aboard a massive, derelict ship, where faith, fanaticism, and abyssal horror collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on the <i>SENARA</i> for reasons unknown, you must survive and escape as it teeters on the edge of ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden cult rituals, forbidden truths, and survivors with their own agendas await you in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/932e42ac559ad35816970db9f81f162c.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/932e42ac559ad35816970db9f81f162c.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/932e42ac559ad35816970db9f81f162c.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival and Escape on a Sealed Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive within the meticulously recreated interior of a massive 6,000-ton ship, facing limited resources and constant threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the structure, discover hidden passages, and gather clues to find the key to your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c08dcd441fdbe93b3bf48872d50593db.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c08dcd441fdbe93b3bf48872d50593db.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c08dcd441fdbe93b3bf48872d50593db.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle- and Exploration-Focused Level Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The densely designed spaces, based on a real ship, gradually open up as the chapters progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items such as documents, equipment, and keys to unlock sealed areas and navigate the complex, intertwined corridors on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-changing threats create fresh tension even within familiar surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c7d002e3b5ed8e08f4312d3ac1740002.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c7d002e3b5ed8e08f4312d3ac1740002.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/c7d002e3b5ed8e08f4312d3ac1740002.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounters with Constant Threatening Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fanatics and bizarre, otherworldly beings relentlessly threaten you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must use limited weapons, strategic stealth, and evasive maneuvers to avoid detection and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/6950451fb9e9741cd0ad854f5d9e37b7.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/6950451fb9e9741cd0ad854f5d9e37b7.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/6950451fb9e9741cd0ad854f5d9e37b7.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Active Story Interpretation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind all events is scattered like pieces across documents, objects, and conversations between characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must find and connect these fragments to construct the story for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on what you believe and how you interpret the clues, the story can unfold in entirely different directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/69d32cfe4c220e3455080158fd109cdb.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/69d32cfe4c220e3455080158fd109cdb.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/69d32cfe4c220e3455080158fd109cdb.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings Based on Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey toward the end, you will face decisive moments of choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These decisions affect not only your escape but also the fate of the <i>SENARA</i> and the flow of truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can decide where this story ultimately leads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61481314be23c184c36ccd4d60f54b8b.poster.avif?t=1767791634\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61481314be23c184c36ccd4d60f54b8b.webm?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61481314be23c184c36ccd4d60f54b8b.mp4?t=1767791634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prologue Episode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Before the Dawn: SENARA Prologue</strong></i> is a short story that explores the past of one of the main characters from the main game, shedding light on the events that began aboard the <i>SENARA</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the first piece of the truth hidden within the confined spaces that continue into the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the beginning of this entire saga for free right now.</p>","developers":["Influsion Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/db0c255373b97c616c53addde299520cca12f198/header.jpg?t=1767791634","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_